---
/**
 * Advertising terms and refund policy, displayed directly beneath the order
 * form and acknowledged at checkout. Deliberately does not invent legal entity
 * details (address, registration, tax ID, jurisdiction) — those must be
 * confirmed by the site owner.
 */
---

<section class="container-max py-12 md:py-16" id="ad-terms" style="background: var(--color-bg-alt);">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Advertising Terms &amp; Refund Policy</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Please read these before you pay — you acknowledge them at checkout.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 space-y-5 text-sm md:text-base">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Prices and discounts</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">All prices are in USD. The long-term discounts shown for 3, 6 and 12 month contracts apply to the displayed contract prices and are already included — the total you see is the total you pay.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Full-Site Sponsorship</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">Full-Site Sponsorship includes the Header, In-Content and Footer placements for your selected duration. It is optional and priced at a discount versus booking the three placements separately.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Creative formats</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">You may submit either advertising text (with a destination link) or your own image in any eligible placement. Both formats cost exactly the same for the same placement and duration. Image creatives must be static PNG, JPEG or WebP, up to 5 MB. Animated images (including GIF, animated WebP and APNG) are not accepted. Uploaded images are validated, resized and optimized to WebP before use; images larger than 1,600&nbsp;pixels wide are scaled down to fit (aspect ratio preserved, never upscaled).</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Review and approval</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">Every submitted creative is subject to review and must comply with TopVPN's advertising policies. Prohibited, misleading, malicious, unlawful, or otherwise unacceptable advertising will not be published. <strong>Payment does not guarantee approval.</strong> Approval and payment are tracked separately, and an ad is never published automatically.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Links and SEO</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">All advertising links are marked with <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">rel="sponsored nofollow"</code>. TopVPN does not sell, and does not promise, any SEO ranking benefit, link equity, or editorial endorsement.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Campaign timing</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">Campaigns begin according to the confirmed agreement and the approval and scheduling process — not automatically at the moment of payment. Once approved, your campaign runs for the full contract duration.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Cancellations and refunds</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">Advertising inventory is reserved for your campaign when you order. For that reason, payments for advertising contracts are generally <strong>non-refundable</strong>, and a cancellation after a campaign has been scheduled or has started does not entitle you to a refund of the remaining term.</p>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--color-muted);">This policy does not override rights you may have under applicable consumer law. Where mandatory statutory rights apply — for example, a legally required refund or withdrawal right — those rights remain in force, and any required refund will be honoured. If a creative is rejected as prohibited and cannot be reasonably remedied, contact us so we can review the situation in line with those rights.</p>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--color-muted);">If you are unsure about committing to a longer term, start with the one-month option and extend later.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1.5">Legal details</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">TopVPN's registered business name, address, registration number, tax details, and the governing jurisdiction for these terms are <strong>to be confirmed by the site owner</strong> and will be stated here once verified. Nothing on this page is intended to state or override applicable law. If a term is found unenforceable, the remaining terms continue to apply.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs pt-2 border-t" style="color: var(--color-muted-dark); border-color: var(--color-border);">
        Questions about these terms before you order? Use the contact page and we will answer before you commit to anything.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
